# Phase 5's second story leg, its first piece (oracle.py's SEQUENCES: terrell; port/tools/oracle/README.md,
# "The comparison sequences"): from the Route 20 save (floccesy_save_b2_us.pbwinput), CONTINUE on
# Route 20 (zone 446) at (130,661), then east along z = 661 into Youngster Terrell's sight (npc 7 of
# res/field/events/route_20.json, at (141,664) facing up, sight 3, so that he stops the player at
# (141,661)), his eye event (res/field/scripts/global_3000.s) and his trainer battle, Tepig against Patrat,
# A every 16 counts for his line, the battle's opening, FIGHT and Tackle: the first turn's choices and
# Tepig's Tackle, up to the cut, count 5488, the last before the foe's move shows in the message. There the
# battle parts from melonDS's by construction: Terrell's AI thinks within 500 ticks of the CPU a pass,
# which takes the DS four passes more than the port, and picks its move with another number, Leer on the
# port and Tackle on the DS (README.md, "Known differences"; ADR 0023). The clock is pinned, which the
# bottom screen shows, and the seed lines are the random seeds the DS builds here (oracle.py seeds
# terrell). On game frames. Black 2. Positions are zone (x,z) tiles; counts are sVBlankCount.
